Package: perglm
Title: Permutation Score Tests for Generalized Linear Models
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: c(
    person("Ziang", "Niu", , "ziangniu@upenn.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description:
    Package infrastructure for permutation-calibrated, empirically studentized
    score tests in generalized linear models, following Ai and Niu (2026)
    <doi:10.48550/arXiv.2611.03255>. This development version contains the
    package skeleton; statistical methods are not yet implemented.
URL: https://github.com/ZiangNiu6/perglm
BugReports: https://github.com/ZiangNiu6/perglm/issues
License: GPL (>= 3)
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.2
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
